OL,3,ADIY SOS to be 'rested' next year to
OL,4,Asave money, BBC says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe long-running home renovation TV
OL,7,Fseries DIY SOS will be "rested" next
OL,8,Fyear in the light of "savings
OL,9,Fchallenges", the BBC has said.
OL,11,FIt will be replaced by a spin-off show
OL,12,Ffeaturing highlights from past
OL,13,Fepisodes. Sources denied reports in the
OL,14,FSun newspaper the programme would be
OL,15,Faxed as part of a plan to make savings.
OL,17,FPresented by Nick Knowles, DIY SOS sees
OL,18,Fa team transform the homes of families
OL,19,Fwho are facing severe illness,
OL,20,Fdisability, bereavement or building
OL,21,Fdisasters.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
